From: Felipe Selmo <felipe.selmo@ethereum.org>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 15:13:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ef_tests: an ethrex-enginetest binary, parallel by
 default

ethrex-enginetest [--bal.sequential] FILE... replays each fixture's payloads through the engine API and prints one JSON verdict per fixture. --bal.sequential builds each context's chain with BAL-parallel execution off, so the same binary judges a payload both ways.
---
